# Companion XR floor anchor (HARD)

User-confirmed working on Galaxy XR (2026-08-24). Do not regress.

## Contract

- WebXR **`local-floor`** (required by `@pmndrs/xr` unless `bounded: false`)
- Scene locomotion / spawn / follow targets / teleport plane: **Y = 0** (`COMPANION_XR_FLOOR_Y`)
- Never teleport or lift the player on XR session enter
- Never `createXRStore({ bounded: false })` or `customSessionInit` without `local-floor`

## Source of truth

`chat/app/src/lib/companion-xr-floor.ts` — used by `companion-xr-store.ts`, `galatea.tsx`, `companion-xr-teleport.tsx`, `player.tsx`.
